"does not require one."

msgid ""
"New tokens use encrypted API token authentication in DHIS2. CHAP Core must "
"support ApiToken authentication. Existing plain-text tokens remain readable "
"until replaced."
msgstr ""
"New tokens use encrypted API token authentication in DHIS2. CHAP Core must "
"support ApiToken authentication. Existing plain-text tokens remain readable "
"until replaced."

